              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Terri Tivis"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Makes a ton and is really easy. My kids enjoyed it too. I added some Chex cereal, marshmallows and white chocolate chips. I think it was almost too sweet when I did that as it has a good taste all by itself!",
