            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Ker"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Was easy, and Tasty. I split the amounts in half. I did add some All-Bran cereal, chopped dates and coconut flakes. I'm pretty sure I could have added whatever fruit or cereal appealed to me and it would've been good. I liked that it wasn't overly sweet. Definitely will make again. Maybe put in dry apples and cinnamon next. It's a very good base. Great topping for yogurt.",
